<!-- ===================== HALAMAN METODE: SMOOTHING ===================== -->
<section class="view" id="view-smoothing">
  <div class="chapter-inner">

    <div class="chapter-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Metode Statistik</span>
      <h1>Metode Smoothing</h1>
      <p class="lede">Ramalkan data deret waktu (time series) dengan Single Moving Average (SMA), Double Moving Average (DMA), Single Exponential Smoothing (SES), Double Exponential Smoothing &mdash; Holt (DES), atau Triple Exponential Smoothing &mdash; Winter (TES), lengkap dengan tabel hasil, langkah manual, grafik, dan evaluasi akurasi (MSE &amp; MAPE).</p>
    </div>

    <section class="card step-card" id="sm-setup-card">
      <div class="step-tag">Langkah 1</div>
      <h2>Pilih jenis smoothing &amp; parameter</h2>
      <p class="hint">Setiap metode smoothing memerlukan parameter yang berbeda. Pilih metode sesuai kebutuhan, lalu tentukan parameternya.</p>
      <div class="control-row">
        <label for="smMethod">Jenis metode</label>
        <select id="smMethod" class="select-input">
          <option value="sma">Single Moving Average (SMA)</option>
          <option value="dma">Double Moving Average (DMA)</option>
          <option value="ses">Single Exponential Smoothing (SES)</option>
          <option value="des">Double Exponential Smoothing &ndash; Holt (DES)</option>
          <option value="tes">Triple Exponential Smoothing &ndash; Winter (TES)</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="control-row" id="smParamSMA">
        <label for="smN">Jumlah periode (n)</label>
